      "sourceTextSha256": "2cccff02f3dacdbfe7f3430dfbd0a88a9795e13861fec1eef4f29f6080e3dea3",
      "text": "Over 26 days, you’ll travel from Mexico City to Panama City through eight countries. Explore Maya cities, colonial streets, textile workshops, and a cigar factory before heading into a landscape of volcanoes, cloud forests, waterfalls, and the canals of Tortuguero. The trip ends with a visit to an Emberá community on the Chagres River and a look at the Panama Canal.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw8xm7mg-7cp5ig",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      }
    },
